@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #9CA3AF
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #F3F4F6
skinparam databaseBorderColor #6B7280
skinparam actorBackgroundColor #FFEDD5
skinparam actorBorderColor #EA580C
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBEB
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9CA3AF

title Anthropic research system: orchestrator, parallel subagents, citation pass

actor User
participant "Lead agent\n(plans, integrates)" as Lead
database "Memory\n(saved plan)" as Mem
participant "Subagents\n(3-5, parallel)" as Sub
participant "Search / tools" as Tools #EDE9FE
participant "CitationAgent" as Cite

autonumber
User -> Lead : research query
Lead -> Lead : plan the research
Lead -> Mem : save plan
note right of Mem
  Context beyond 200k tokens is
  truncated, so the plan must survive
end note

group parallel fan-out of reads: own context window, tools, prompt
  Lead -> Sub : scoped brief per subagent\n(objective, output format,\ntool guidance, task boundaries)
  Sub -> Tools : search and read
  Tools --> Sub : results
  Sub --> Lead : final answer only\n(compact result)
end
note over Lead, Sub
  Subagents run synchronously
  (a known bottleneck)
end note

Lead -> Lead : integrate findings
Lead -> Cite : report to attribute
Cite --> Lead : claims attributed to sources
Lead --> User : final report\n(one agent writes it)
@enduml
